{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"701","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"亞馬遜雨林新火不斷 野火也肆虐非洲","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">2019-08-25 14:55<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">中央社 巴西維洛港<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">24</span>日綜合外電報導</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">官方資料今天顯示，又有數百起新的火勢在巴西的亞馬遜雨林燃起。在全球強烈關注後，巴西投入數千名官兵力抗這波近年最嚴重的森林野火。而非洲也有多起野火發生。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">法新社報導，專家們表示，數月旱季期間為清出土地供種植作物與放牧，都讓問題加劇。有超過一半的野火發生在廣大的亞馬遜流域，有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2000</span>萬人居住於這片區域。據巴西的國家太空署（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">INPE</span>）的資料，約有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1663</span>起新的火勢是在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">22</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">23</span>日期間燃起。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">本週稍早，巴西總統波索納洛（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Jair Bolsonaro</span>）還指控是部分非政府組織因資金被刪而蓄意製造這些野火。言論向來對環境不友善的波索納洛今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>月就任，而他被指為破壞亞馬遜與原住民部落的元凶。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">美國有線電視新聞網（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CNN</span>）引述世界自然基金會（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">WWF</span>）指出，亞馬遜雨林的面積是印度國土面積的兩倍，是世界現存最大的熱帶雨林，擁有至少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10%</span>以上的世界生物物種，釋放出的氧氣占地球總氧氣的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20%</span>，幫忙調節全球氣溫。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">亞馬遜雨林本週的大火才讓人們意識到，如果沒有亞馬遜雨林，氣候變遷恐變為無可逆轉。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">據<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">WWF</span>的資料，亞馬遜雨林可吸取<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">900</span>億到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1400</span>億噸的碳排，而氣候變遷背後的主因之一就是大氣的碳排過量。亞馬遜雨林就像一個巨大的聚碳盆，如果燒掉了，碳排會全部跑進大氣，將會是毀滅性結果。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">亞馬遜雨林能幫助調節全球氣候，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">WWF</span>指出，破壞亞馬遜雨林的結果，就會在世界各地看到更多的極端氣溫，當中包括在一些地區發生極度乾旱與四季交替現象出現變化。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">亞馬遜雨林野火已迫使波索納洛必須改弦更張環境政策，但據專門提供各類氣候資料的組織<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">WeatherSource</span>分析衛星數據顯示，過去<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">48</span>小時以來，巴西在全球野火發生數不過排第三。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">Weather Source</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">在過去<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">48</span>小時於非洲的安哥拉記錄到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6902</span>起野火，民主剛果<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3395</span>起，巴西則為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2127</span>起。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">:</span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">https://udn.com/news/story/6809/4009236?from=udn-referralnews_ch2artbottom</span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-08-29","clk_count":"190"}},"__N_SSG":true}